# One analog write per completed child await, in order. Slot reuse must not drop
# or duplicate a value while the String-bearing payload is released; the second
# write reads the payload's `label.length()` (1), proving the string box survived
# until the consumer read it.
analog 3 1
analog 4 1
analog 3 2
analog 4 1
analog 3 3
analog 4 1
analog 3 4
analog 4 1
analog 3 5
analog 4 1
analog 3 6
analog 4 1
